      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "****PLEASE NOTE THAT THIS PROPERTY WILL ONLY BE SHOWN TO TENANTS WHO HAVE COMPLETED THE ATTACHED TENANT APPLICATION FORM**** SCAN THE QR CODE TO APPLY ***\nThis is a 2nd time let of an upmarket luxury property. Completed & presented to the highest standard, this home is really unique in the rental market today. Extending to over 2,000 sq. ft., the following accommodation is offered: entrance foyer with double doors leading to the foyer -directly ahead there is a large carpeted family lounge with wrap around windows & double doors leading to the patio area. A solid fuel stove forms a focal point & there are also vaulted ceilings.\nThe kitchen, dining & living area are open plan & really exquisite. The kitchen is soft white with ample built in units, a state of the art cooker with 6 ring gas hob & double oven The dining area is situated by double windows affording fabulous views of the surrounding countryside. There is a raised recessed solid fuel stove at the living area, where there is also a large corner couch. A very spacious utility with fully built in units & guest WC plus hot press is adjacent to the kitchen.\nThere is a 2nd family room to the front of the kitchen which would ideally suit a home office, study, playroom etc.\nThere are four generously size double bedrooms & the master boasts an en-suite & walk in wardrobe.\nThe main bathroom is with bath & separate walk in shower.\nFeatures of this home include generous use of walnut flooring, underfloor heating, heated towel rails, state of the art kitchen, good internet connection, solid fuel stoves by 2, bespoke sanitary ware to name but a few. It comes with an impressive BER cert of B2, making heating costs very efficient. Electric vehicle charging point installed at the property\nThe property is located on a half acre elevate site, approx 7 mins to Oughterard, 10 mins to Moycullen, it is a mere 2 kms from the main Moycullen Oughterard road. It is approx 25 mins to NUIG & UCHG\nAn excellent school to both Oughterad & Roscahill is available from right outside the door.\nThis residence is sure to impress the most discerning client who`s criteria is a quality home combined with a good location. \nStrictly no pets, No Smoking. \n"
      },
      {
