        "Content": "<ul><li> 2nd time let of upmarket 4 bedroom luxury home in Roscahill </li><li> Coming fully furnished with top quality finishes </li><li> Underfloor heating throughout </li><li> 4 spacious double bedrooms with 2 en suite & master with walk in dressing room </li><li> State of the art kitchen with walnut worktops & top quality built in appliances </li><li> 2 solid fuel stoves </li><li> Heated towel rails & bespoke sanitary ware </li><li> Elevated site with panoramic views of surrounding countryside </li><li> Good internet connection & Electric vehicle charging point installed at the property </li><li> 7 min to Oughterard & 10 mins to Moycullen</li></ul>"
